invariant: INV-45
file: src/sha3_andn.h
catches: sha3_equiv_test
reason: one line of the ANDN form's chi takes its two neighbours in each
  other's place, so the round is no longer FIPS 202's and every digest of
  sha3_hw.c's x86-64 copy is wrong. bin/sha3_equiv_test runs the form on
  every machine and requires the reference's state.

--- old
    out[7] = b7 ^ (~b8 & b9);
--- new
    out[7] = b7 ^ (~b9 & b8);
